Definitions.
- In these rules, unless the context otherwise requires,-
(a)
"Act" means the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 (Central Act 16 of 2016);
(b)
"Agreement for Sale" means an agreement for sale and/or construction agreement as prescribed in Annexure 'A' to
these rules;
(c)
"Association" means the Association referred to in rule 10;
(d)
"authenticated copy" means a self-attested copy of any document required to be provided by any person under these
rules;
(e)
"Form" means a form appended to these rules;
(f)
"Government" means the Government of Tamil Nadu;
(g)
"layout plan" means a plan of the project depicting the division or proposed division of land into plots, roads, open
spaces, amenities, etc., and other details as may be necessary;
(h)
"Ongoing project" means, a project where development is going on and for which completion certificate has not been
issued but excludes such projects which fulfill any of the following criteria on the date of coming into force of sub-section
